      "filename": "Quartzose sandstones (Mazomanie Formation, Upper Cambrian; riverside cliff, western side of the St. Croix River, northeast of Lookout Point, Minnesota, USA) 4 (18811819890).jpg",
      "title": "File:Quartzose sandstones (Mazomanie Formation, Upper Cambrian; riverside cliff, western side of the St. Croix River, northeast of Lookout Point, Minnesota, USA) 4 (18811819890).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6b/Quartzose_sandstones_%28Mazomanie_Formation%2C_Upper_Cambrian%3B_riverside_cliff%2C_western_side_of_the_St._Croix_River%2C_northeast_of_Lookout_Point%2C_Minnesota%2C_USA%29_4_%2818811819890%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Quartzose_sandstones_(Mazomanie_Formation,_Upper_Cambrian;_riverside_cliff,_western_side_of_the_St._Croix_River,_northeast_of_Lookout_Point,_Minnesota,_USA)_4_(18811819890).jpg",
